---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Backdrop from '../components/Backdrop.astro';
import { scripture, values } from '../data/site';

const title = 'What We Stand For — Stag Acquisitions';
const description =
  'Stag Acquisitions is a family business built on Christian faith. That shows up as honest numbers, straight answers, no pressure, and being plain about where we stand in a deal.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <header class="hero hero-short">
    <Backdrop
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470071459604-3b5ec3a7fe05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=80"
      variant="hero"
      priority
    />
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our values</span>
      <h1>What we <em>stand for.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Most people find us at a hard moment — a house they cannot carry, an estate nobody wants to
        deal with, a decision that has waited too long. How we handle that is the whole business.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" id="faith">
    <div class="section-inner" style="max-width: 900px;">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">At the center</span>
        <h2>A family business built on faith.</h2>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="verse" data-reveal>
        <p>{scripture.text}</p>
        <cite>{scripture.reference} <span>({scripture.translation})</span></cite>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p class="lead">
          We are a family-owned company, and our Christian faith is the reason we do this the way we
          do. It is not a marketing line and it is not something we keep in a drawer for Sundays.
        </p>
        <p>
          An honest scale is a small thing. Nobody applauds you for it and no one is watching most
          of the time. That is exactly why it matters. In this business the temptation is always the
          same — shade a number, stay quiet about something the other side has not asked, let a
          person believe what is convenient for you. We are not willing to build on that, because we
          believe we answer for it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Real estate at this end of the market runs on people in difficult circumstances. Treating
          them as a problem to be worked is the normal thing. We think it is the wrong thing. That
          applies to everyone who calls us, without exception.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bright" id="practice">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">In practice</span>
        <h2>What that actually looks like.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Values are cheap to write down. These are the four we can be held to, and you are welcome
          to hold us to them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-4">
        {values.map((value, index) => (
          <div class="feature" data-reveal data-reveal-delay={String(index + 1)}>
            <h3>{value.title}</h3>
            <p>{value.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section ambient" id="where-we-stand">
    <Backdrop
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487958449943-2429e8be8625?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80"
      variant="ambient"
    />
    <div class="section-inner" style="max-width: 860px;">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Where we stand</span>
        <h2>Being honest with you includes<br />being honest about us.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p class="lead">
          Plenty of companies in this space stay vague about which side of the table they sit on.
          We would rather tell you exactly where we sit, because a disclosure buried in paperwork is
          not the same as saying it out loud.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are a principal. We buy for our own account and in our own interest, and we may assign
          the agreement to one of our developer or investor clients, who may close in our place. We
          are not your agent or broker, we do not represent you, and we owe you no fiduciary duty.
          Our interests and yours are not the same, and you should have your own attorney look at
          anything before you sign it.
        </p>
        <p>
          None of that conflicts with treating you honestly — it is the beginning of it. You cannot
          deal straight with someone who is unclear about what you are.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 3.5rem;" data-reveal>
        <a class="cta-ghost" href="/disclosures">
          Read the full disclosures
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner center" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Next step</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;">Talk to us and see.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="max-width: 50ch; margin: 0 auto 3rem;">
          The fastest way to judge any of this is to put us on the phone and find out.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content: center;">
          <a class="cta" href="/offer">
            Submit your property
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a class="cta-ghost" href="/investors">I am buying</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
